> [J]omsom Muktinath Trek[ is an] exciting trek in the Annapurna and Mustang regions of Nepal. The 13-day trek begins from Kathmandu with the tour of UNESCO World Heritage Sites[.] Next, we fly to Pokh[ara], the beautiful Lake[ City and] begin trekking from there. We trek in the beautiful Annapurna region and gradually enter the Mustang region.
